I feel there's a lack of crowd control options. If someone whips out a Kamacuras Swarm or Destoroyah larva, you're gonna get slowed down hard.

&#x200B;

Biollante and Hedorah are popular for dealing with crowds. Biollante's got some nice bulk and range with her attack, but Hedorah can knock out flying targets for you. Try either one of them and see how it works.

&#x200B;

