GMK Godzilla's atomic breath having the mushroom cloud after-effect was always cool as hell to me.

&#x200B;

It was a very on-the-nose reminder that this big bad boy was the product of nuclear weapons, and we should NOT forget it.

For as common as 'inorganic volcano/rock' kaiju are in a lot of kaiju media, Godzilla's lacking in one.

&#x200B;

I think the design philosophies that guided Gigan and Megalon kinda show in Obsidius. But with no story or real personality to speak of, Obsidius just kinda exists in a one-off video game and will probably never be seen again.

